    "label": "D1 沒有證據也填一個看起來很合理的測試指令（一個永遠不會失敗的驗證指令＝每一次執行都拿到綠燈）",
    "file": "app/services/project_detection.py",
    "replace": "    return Finding(\n        t(\"detect.cell.verify\"), \"\", t(\"detect.because.no_test_config\"), UNKNOWN\n    )",
    "with": "    return Finding(\n        t(\"detect.cell.verify\"), \"pytest\", t(\"detect.because.no_test_config\"), UNKNOWN\n    )",
    "test": "tests/test_the_detection_card_says_how_sure_it_is.py::test_no_marker_means_unknown_not_a_made_up_command"
  },
  {
    "label": "D2 「查不到版本控制」被寫成「沒有版本控制」（他以為 AICC 檢查過了，而 repo 的根可能在上一層）",
    "file": "app/services/project_detection.py",
    "replace": "    return Finding(\n        t(\"detect.cell.version_control\"),\n        \"\",\n        t(\"detect.because.no_git\"),\n        UNKNOWN,\n    )",
    "with": "    return Finding(\n        t(\"detect.cell.version_control\"),\n        \"沒有\",\n        t(\"detect.because.no_git\"),\n        SURE,\n    )",
    "test": "tests/test_the_detection_card_says_how_sure_it_is.py::test_no_git_says_cannot_tell_not_says_none"
  },
  {
    "label": "D3 專案名稱被相對路徑吃成空白（卡片看起來像「AICC 查不到你的專案叫什麼」，而那是假象）",
    "file": "app/services/project_detection.py",
    "replace": "    resolved = project.expanduser().resolve()",
    "with": "    resolved = project",
    "test": "tests/test_the_detection_card_says_how_sure_it_is.py::test_the_project_name_is_never_blank_because_of_a_relative_path"
  },
  {
    "label": "D4 每一格都標成「要注意」（全部標等於沒有標，那格空的驗證指令淹沒在裡面）",
    "file": "app/services/project_detection.py",
    "replace": "        return self.confidence in (GUESSED, UNKNOWN)",
    "with": "        return True",
    "test": "tests/test_the_detection_card_says_how_sure_it_is.py::test_the_cells_he_should_look_at_are_singled_out"
  },
  {
